 0 \\\\ 1 & -\\sqrt{2} & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}|\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186420351 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "2642af15-1045-5d0f-97c1-3ce034155f08" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186420351 #edb/ref 1074 "Let's examine each of the given determinants in turn. \n\n- The matrix $A$ has identical columns: \n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 4 & 5 & \\sqrt{3} & 5 \\\\ 0 & 8 & -1 & 8 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nAs a result, $|A|=0.$\n\n- The matrix $B$ has identical rows: \n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & \\sqrt{7} & 1 \\\\ 2 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 3 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nAs a result, $|B|=0.$\n\n- The matrix $C$ has a zero row: \n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -\\sqrt{2} & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nAs a result, $|C|=0.$\n\nTherefore, $|A|,$ $|B|,$ and $|C|$ are equal to $0.$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186420353 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186475337 #edb/ref 17592186045436] [17592186420353 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186475338 #edb/ref 17592186045436] [17592186420353 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186475339 #edb/ref 17592186045436] [17592186420353 #edb/ref 1069 "q-42463" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186420353 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186420353 #edb/ref 1071 "$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 6 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nConsider the matrix given above. Identify **all** of the reasons why one can conclude that $|A|=0?$\n- **I.** $A$ has identical rows\n- **II.** $A$ has proportional columns\n- **III.** $A$ has a zero row\n\nSelect all that apply." #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186420353 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "d2486be8-75b8-51f1-882e-08f8a79961f2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186420353 #edb/ref 1074 "Let's examine each of the statements in turn.\n\n- $A$ does *not* have identical rows.\n\n- $A$ does *not* have proportional columns.\n\n- $A$ has a zero row: \n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 6 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\,✓\n$$\n\nTher